    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfb9d96d7e3660847794fe8e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆",
      "source_fingerprint": "33a0f36db3e54f4e2fa022c8d29dd07a8f024a475cae2ddfb01ad1c1967834f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        63,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/63/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a07dea1e101082440a91d49",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "英雄……她们──\n各自都有──奔跑的理由──",
      "source_fingerprint": "43421c68279fada10dfb0916f6963a9c6490b5e0cff29b9bc286a193a10ad6db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        63,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/63/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b7f9dd70f376ae123a7bfe8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错。那当然是大前提。\n每个赛马娘都有只属于自己的理由。\n但是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c85794ae17df203ea5b34952fd2877198f08a3f43a871fb48e4ae24f48252ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        64,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/64/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab28ac94be93f5d246883c93",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──因为你比任何人都“冷淡”",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5702dfd23b4468f293116908a4e4abb384590573934f8669b045571cc492b58",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b5e341da69246423aa1b279",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──因为你比任何人都“冷淡”",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5702dfd23b4468f293116908a4e4abb384590573934f8669b045571cc492b58",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1953708ce73e25485a047de1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "让那个奔跑的理由之中，\n点燃更多热情的原因是什么？\n吉兆一定没有注意到这一点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcc0dc6822664d6c9207011adddd88f38a2b21fba458c65cf066fe19a4ec0e61",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5b25c5a02618dce51079575",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆",
      "source_fingerprint": "33a0f36db3e54f4e2fa022c8d29dd07a8f024a475cae2ddfb01ad1c1967834f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        66,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/66/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c97b88a1feccaa8a4e75f3a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……因为……我……冷淡……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "215705e5eda3b2b9368de65b7f6936fd18ace54ae49f052eac2e915368076892",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        66,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/66/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0b2b915c8f2741a646eab3b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我用力地点了点头，但为了避免任何误解，\n随后开始阐述了我内心的想法──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d7c7d2c4bb53375c3433d93cb47101f1d52ac9a65be3aa5877233abdb1676b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        67,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/67/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54274fea5b64553ee07806cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛马娘吉兆，\n其独一无二的特征、最大的优势，那就是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff2d9998016905b2a23808850719b38e4200d563ce2fdc3c67e857cf2b3b7683",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        68,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/68/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0595f5397b89128aa1f8896b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "坚定不移，会冷静、确实、踏实，\n默默地累积“成果”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d043baab630ac53c7f06e60cd3aa0f5fe6da4a86249e73c87621bd566ccfd95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        69,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/69/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31fd07995db0ae752652c97e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……看来是跳舞城的粉丝们\n在参观她的公开训练时为她加油。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5869b29e560086d3ad3291781aec09fa8ea71234b33a78265dc449ad3b34d0ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a941b2ce3e585cb16377db7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这种甚至可以说是无情，\n且极尽彻底的决心与步调──\n正是吉兆“冷风”的真面目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94b37d80bb0c0b51120c20629f4a437698af7ba063038cafcadd66b0cb65f2ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        70,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/70/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96d0af4d2afd37bae21b5039",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所有与她竞赛过的赛马娘，\n都体验过这压倒性且不留情面的“冷风”吧──",
      "source_fingerprint": "70b1cefdc32709f6ea4855dce533cce1e22dbd95f7989259684458a55620cbbe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        71,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/71/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88c56e01f4d8d3e43da1b9ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与吉兆竞争的赛马娘，\n一定会为了克服那“冷风”而振奋精神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54ec93216da2c0a923d0dd778f67a6b0028577c50e0cb1e040ad5b38e4d60b94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        72,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/72/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee0e3b0ebc2109aa2a623d38",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "并意识到，或是燃起──\n存在于自己心中的奔跑理由──那灵魂之火。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93e1a4b8d62933899d9b5caef542896f8cdd1104c328f8334d831657a4dab4a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        73,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/73/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59d656e873a245aad1415bfe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们会将火焰……“热情”熊熊燃起，\n为了克服吉兆的“冷风”，\n跨越自己的极限之扉──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e3a504dbd479c7bdbfe94f7e8294aef86f440d7ca93487c49c504ce16852607",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        74,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/74/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cec79dd0215d42361afa5ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了追上、超越吉兆……\n她们会炙热地……\n无比灼热地，猛烈燃烧……",
